# Docker build context is the repository root (see apps/trade/Dockerfile and apps/acat/Dockerfile). Keep it to what the image uses.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/test-results
**/.wrangler
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage
**/.env
**/.env.*
# Local stores of files the dev server writes; the help desk image generates its own seeded attachments.
**/.local-attachments
**/.local-object-copies
.git
.github
.githooks
.claude
plans
tools
**/__tests__
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/*.spec.ts
**/*.spec.tsx
# Of the other workspaces, only their package.json (for npm ci) and the synthetic universe.
site/*
!site/package.json
synthetic/*
!synthetic/package.json
!synthetic/out
